<title>RUSSIA: Russian PPI quickens to 1.3 pct monthly in January.</title>
<headline>Russian PPI quickens to 1.3 pct monthly in January.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian monthly industrial prices rose 1.3 percent in January after 0.8 percent in December, the State Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN INDUSTRIAL PRICES  JAN 97    DEC 96    JAN 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month pct change    +1.3	+0.8	+3.2</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change     +22.8     +25.6    +133.0</p>
<p>Inflation typically picks up in January for seasonal reasons.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
